{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/intro.gif?t=1744991141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a handcrafted 2D pixel action-adventure that blends fluid combat with bullet-hell mechanics. Master unique abilities like the teleportation dagger and bullet counter to overcome enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an emotional journey about facing loss and overcoming grief. Explore a handcrafted world filled with secrets to uncover and challenges to face. Explore the enchanting and mysterious world brought to life with it\u2019s handcrafted pixel-art and moving soundtracks, delivering an emotional experience that stays with you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use unique mechanics to teleport and interact your way through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/teleport.gif?t=1744991141\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through lovingly crafted, beautiful landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/waterfall.gif?t=1744991141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover hidden secrets and interact with the environment as you venture through the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/activation.gif?t=1744991141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash and dodge your way through tough bullet challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/bullet.gif?t=1744991141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an emotionally moving story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/cut_scene.gif?t=1744991141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in thrilling combat against challenging enemies and bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/boss_fight.gif?t=1744991141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876290?t=1744991141","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876290?t=1744991141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/ddf94133d6a6482a3cc0c0fc87596268c9e11849/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744991141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/ddf94133d6a6482a3cc0c0fc87596268c9e11849/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744991141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3244790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/intro.gif?t=1744991141